        "implementation": "通过 getTotalLength() 设置每条 path 的 strokeDasharray/strokeDashoffset；主干使用 power2.out，叶脉使用 none；不猜测长度，不使用弹性 ease。",
        "timing": "主干 0.48s 同时绘制；域级路径按三主枝错开 0.08s；叶脉按域波次绘制，每波不超过 0.50s。"
      },
      "spring-pop-entrance": {
        "use_for": [
          "root node",
          "three branch nodes",
          "ten domain nodes",
          "capability micro-leaves"
        ],
        "implementation": "fromTo 明确 scale/opacity 起态；企业级默认 power3.out 长尾落位，无 back.out、无 elastic、无 bounce。微节点 scale 0.55→1，避免 143 个节点同时从零产生闪烁。",
        "timing": "节点必须在对应路径抵达端点后 0.04–0.10s 内出现；每组总 stagger 窗口不超过 0.50s。"
      },
      "counting-dynamic-scale": {
        "use_for": [
          "root total counter 0→143",
          "domain count badges",
          "branch subtotals 65/44/34"
        ],
        "implementation": "DOM 文本通过 seek-safe onUpdate 更新；数字使用 tabular-nums；值增加时最多 scale 0.92→1.04→1，末值严格落在 143。",
        "timing": "域徽标随本域原子点完成即锁定；总计数 5.55–6.35s 从 0 加速到 143，6.35s 后保持。"
      },
      "ambient-glow-bloom": {
        "use_for": [
          "root power-on",
          "Russia/Ozon branch focus",
          "final resolved tree"
        ],
        "implementation": "专用 halo 层置于节点后方；peak opacity 不超过 0.28；一次 bloom + 有界 hold，不使用 repeat/yoyo/CSS transition。",
        "timing": "根节点 0.00–0.75s；Russia/Ozon 5.90–6.85s；全树 7.15–8.50s。"
      }
